---
import AboutPhoto from '../assets/about-photo.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Dondi"
	pubDate={new Date()}
	heroImage={AboutPhoto}
	size="small"
	tags={[]}
>
	<p>
		Materials engineering student and a freelance translator by day, though I am currently more interested in <em>why a four-legged gait looks wrong?</em>
	</p>
	<p>
		This blog is a notebook in which I will store my <strong>thoughts and experiments</strong>, from the <em>genome parameters that didn't work</em>, through the <em>physics that fought back</em>, to the tech demos <em>built just to prove a point</em>. Not a portfolio of finished things, but a record of trial and error, which brought me here.
	</p>
	<p>
		Currently building a spider evolution sim <em>(name still pending)</em> in Godot, occasionally posting technical breakdowns, and slowly discovering that materials science and gameplay systems design ask <em>a lot</em> of similar questions.
	</p>
	<p>
		<span class="margin-note" style="font-size: 1.8em;">I hope you will have a good time reading through my adventures!</span>
	</p>
</Layout>